        "en": "Label: use with caution in older adults, usually starting at the low end of the dose range."
      },
      "quote": "… ng life-threatening or fatal occurrences of the following: encephalopathy, myoclonus, and seizures [see Warnings and Precautions ( 5.2 ), Adverse Reactions ( 6.2 )] .",
